Historian: {
	DisplayName: Historian

	TownNPCMood: {
		Content: I am content.
		NoHome: I will take the fact that I am out here still as a no to my intial question.
		FarFromHome: Must’ve gotten lost once more. I will never learn the pathways of this place.
		LoveSpace: Finally, peace. You never realise how good you have it until it’s gone do you? I’ll have to write that down, I’m sure the people back home would love to hear that result.
		DislikeCrowded: I’m sorry if this is demanding but… Can you please find me somewhere quieter? It’s like I’m back at home with such chattering.
		HateCrowded: I hate how crowded I am.
		LikeBiome: I haven’t seen much nature in my life sadly, I’ve always been rather fond of it however. All the animals and plants, tiny little ecosystems. I wonder if they consider us as fascinating as we consider them, haha..
		HateBiome: I-uh- I appreciate t-the housing but please get me out of here. This place h-highly disturbs me, I want out, now.
		LikeNPC: I wasn’t expecting to find a like minded sort here. Fortunately {NPCName} is just brimming with conversational topics!
		DislikeNPC: Put some discipline into {NPCName}. I don’t think I can take the mental toll of seeing another one of his fungus riddled fish.
		HateNPC: Move me away please… I cannot be in the presence of {NPCName}.
		LikeNPC_Princess: While I doubt the… legitimacy of {NPCName}’s title, I cannot deny and say she wouldn’t excel in that position. Honestly the most pleasant royal I’ve talked to, if she is one.
		Princess_LovesNPC: I like {NPCName}.
	}

	Census.SpawnCondition: Conditions unknown
}

